      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "Python Assignment: Lambda, map(), filter(), reduce(), and Combined Operations"
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "5CxNxDIh0Y83"
      }
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "1.Question 1\n",
        "number = 8\n",
        "Write a lambda expression to calculate the square of number."
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "uaX9g4c41NAZ"
      }
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": 3,
      "metadata": {
        "colab": {
          "base_uri": "https://localhost:8080/"
        },
        "id": "-ZrLsJkR0W7d",
        "outputId": "ce4cfcb8-cfca-4a7c-c7e3-4819dc0fb266"
      },
      "outputs": [
        {
          "output_type": "stream",
          "name": "stdout",
          "text": [
            "64\n"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "source": [
        "number=8\n",
        "square=lambda x: x ** 2\n",
        "result=square(number)\n",
        "\n",
        "print(result)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "2.number = 5\n",
        "Write a lambda expression to calculate the cube of number."
