        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "15.fahrenheit = 104\n",
        "Write a lambda expression to convert Fahrenheit into Celsius."
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "BRDYekFW9q5F"
      }
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "fahrenheit = 104\n",
