      "outputs": [
        {
          "output_type": "stream",
          "name": "stdout",
          "text": [
            "45\n"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "20.marks = 72\n",
        "Write a lambda expression that returns:\n",
        "\n",
        "\"Distinction\" when marks are 75 or above\n",
        "\"Pass\" when marks are 40 to 74\n",
        "\"Fail\" when marks are below 40"
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "TFG-nRtV-7fl"
      }
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "marks = 72\n",
        "grade = lambda m: \"Distinction\" if m >= 75 else \"Pass\" if m >= 40 else\"Fail\"\n",
        "result = grade(marks)\n",
        "print(result)"
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "colab": {
          "base_uri": "https://localhost:8080/"
        },
        "id": "oghIatUw_A65",
        "outputId": "f84a9481-92b6-48e6-b00f-5bccd3b86ac7"
      },
      "execution_count": 24,
      "outputs": [
        {
          "output_type": "stream",
          "name": "stdout",
          "text": [
            "Pass\n"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "Map()"
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "ctk_i_JKDblO"
      }
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "1.numbers = [1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6]\n",
        "Using map() and a lambda expression, calculate the square of every number"
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "2Erk5OaWDfam"
      }
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "numbers = [1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6]\n",
        "squares = list(map(lambda x: x** 2, numbers))\n",
        "print(squares)"
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "colab": {
          "base_uri": "https://localhost:8080/"
        },
        "id": "YVSZgcDJDliG",
        "outputId": "0bb76e96-deac-46d8-95c7-d12c3998a7cf"
      },
      "execution_count": 25,
      "outputs": [
        {
          "output_type": "stream",
          "name": "stdout",
          "text": [
            "[1, 4, 9, 16, 25, 36]\n"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "2.numbers = [2, 3, 4, 5, 6]\n",
        "Using map() and a lambda expression, calculate the cube of every number"
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "0KogLKMiDxgV"
      }
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "numbers = [1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6]\n",
        "cube = list(map(lambda x:x**3, numbers))\n",
        "print(cube)"
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "colab": {
          "base_uri": "https://localhost:8080/"
        },
        "id": "1IXcvZU-D1J_",
        "outputId": "f45b9772-3a5d-44ea-c1ee-1a3a3d77f7c7"
      },
      "execution_count": 26,
      "outputs": [
        {
          "output_type": "stream",
          "name": "stdout",
          "text": [
            "[1, 8, 27, 64, 125, 216]\n"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "3.numbers = [10, 20, 30, 40, 50]\n",
        "Using map(), add 5 to every number."
