    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "20.numbers = [12, 45, 12, 67, 45, 89, 23, 67, 100]\n",
        "Using reduce(), calculate the sum of unique numbers only. Do not directly use sum(set(numbers))."
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "37xaB57EKMVp"
      }
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "from functools import reduce\n",
        "\n",
        "numbers = [12, 45, 12, 67, 45, 89, 23, 67, 100]\n",
        "unique_sum = reduce(\n",
        "    lambda acc, x: (acc[0] + x, acc[1] | {x}) if x not in acc[1] else (acc[0], acc[1]),\n",
        "    numbers,\n",
        "    (0, set())\n",
        ")[0]\n",
        "print(unique_sum)"
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "colab": {
          "base_uri": "https://localhost:8080/"
        },
        "id": "yd9kt4kbKTK6",
        "outputId": "eee038f6-40df-45cf-9370-75b40aa3bf46"
      },
      "execution_count": 52,
      "outputs": [
        {
          "output_type": "stream",
          "name": "stdout",
          "text": [
            "336\n"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "Combined Lambda, map(), filter(), and reduce()"
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "hoIHxAPoKbOX"
      }
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "1.numbers = [12, 45, 67, 89, 23, 56, 91, 34, 78, 100]\n",
        "Using filter() and map():\n",
        "\n",
        "Extract all even numbers.\n",
        "Calculate the square of every even number.\n",
        "Return the squared values as a list."
      ],
